(when * blocks passage)
	(current room #n-workshop)
	(current player $Player)
	~(#blindfold has ancestor $Player)
	It wouldn’t be hard to move through the light in this direction, but if you left the blindfold behind, how would you ever get back?
	(if) (player can see #blindfold) (then)
		Better (link [take the blindfold]) {take it with you}.
	(endif)
(descr *) It’s a focused, directed ray that almost reminds you of a laser, or a sunbeam shining through dust. From the side you can clearly see its path traced out in fiery gold.

