(perform [push/pull/turn * | $])
	(if) ~(statue is turned) (then)
		Squinting against the glare, you take hold of the platform—(no space) (emph {not}) touching the statue itself—and give it a mighty heave. It shakes and rocks, tilting dangerously to one side for a moment...but then it starts to turn. Marduk’s gaze burns a fiery trail across the wall until it’s aimed safely away from the doors.
		(now) (statue is turned)
	(else)
