(look *) Or perhaps “construction site”? This area is an odd mixture of old and new: ({surveying lines}) are laid out over crumbling walls, piles of new ({bricks}) carted in to join to the old. Two real passages cut through the maze of chest-high and waist-high walls, one leading north, the other south.

