(late on every tick)
	(current room $Room)
	~(vignette $Room)
	~(any vignette is unvisited)
	(select)
		(par) That should be the last one—you’ve explored every corner of these disjointed memories, and gathered more data than your advisor could have dreamed. Now all you have to do is put it together.
		(div @meta) {
			You’re free to keep exploring as long as you like. When you’re satisfied with your discoveries, type (command link {FINISH}) to wrap things up.
		}
		(now) (finish command unlocked)
	(or)
	(stopping)

(understand command [finish])
(prevent [finish])
	(any vignette is unvisited)
	Your work isn’t finished yet—there are still more
	(if)
		(#n-ziqqurat is visited)
		(#s-palace is visited)
		(#m-unfinished is visited)
	(then)
		bone fragments to track down and
	(endif)
	memories to explore!
(perform [finish])
	(the end)

(the end)
	There you have it: everything you might need for your thesis. You
	(if) (dreaming) (then)
		hyperventilate yourself back to the physical world
	(endif)
	and make your way out of the archaeological dig, back to your bike, back to the motel, and eventually, back to the university. You’ve witnessed things no human being has seen in millennia—the department will (emph {have}) to give you a doctorate for this! (par)
	Now, you just have to write it...
	(game over {The End})

(game over option)
	see the real (link) HISTORY behind this game
(parse game over [history])
	(history)

(history)
	(if) (interpreter supports links) (then) %% Web terp with links
		(div @meta) {
			(link resource @history) { Click here to open the history in a new tab. }
			\( It’s rather long! \)
		}
	(elseif) (interpreter supports quit) (then) %% Offline
		(div @meta) {
			You’ll find the history in the file (span @command) {history.html} included in the download. \( It’s long enough that it doesn’t fit nicely in an interpreter window—sorry about that! \)
		}
	(else) %% Web terp without links
		(div @meta) {
			You’ll find the history in the file (span @command) {history.html} included in the download. If you turn on links, you can also open it in a new tab (link resource @history) {here}.
		}
	(endif)

(define resource @history) history.html
